getflag 3t "t3"
getflag 4t "t4"
op add c1 c1 1
op mod c2 c1 expoc
op mod c3 c1 multc
fetch buildCount expoc @crux 0 @exponential-reconstructor
fetch build expo @crux c2 @exponential-reconstructor
fetch buildCount multc @crux 0 @multiplicative-reconstructor
fetch build mult @crux c3 @multiplicative-reconstructor
control enabled expo 4t 0 0 0
control enabled mult 3t 0 0 0
